# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
# Trustfile — Trust boundaries and integrity invariants for hybrid-automation-router
# Author: Jonathan D.A. Jewell <j.d.a.jewell@open.ac.uk>
#
# Defines what LLM/SLM agents are trusted to do without asking, and
# integrity invariants that verify the repo has not been tampered with.

@abstract:
Trust boundaries and integrity checks for hybrid-automation-router (HAR).
Defines what AI agents may do autonomously and what requires human
approval, plus checks that verify repository integrity.
@end

## Trust Levels

hybrid-automation-router operates at trust level: maximal

Trust levels:
- maximal:    Agent may read, build, test, lint, format, heal freely.
             Only destructive/external actions require approval.
- standard:   Agent may read and build. Test/lint need approval.
- restricted: Agent may read only. All modifications need approval.
- minimal:    Agent may read specific files only. Everything else blocked.

Current trust level: maximal

## Integrity Invariants

### Secrets

#### no-secrets-committed
- description: No credential files in repo
- run: test ! -f .env && test ! -f credentials.json && test ! -f .env.local && test ! -f .env.production
- severity: critical

#### no-private-keys
- description: No private key files committed
- run: "! find . -name '*.pem' -o -name '*.key' -o -name 'id_rsa' -o -name 'id_ed25519' 2>/dev/null | grep -v target | head -1 | grep -q ."
- severity: critical

#### no-tokens-in-source
- description: No hardcoded API tokens in source
- run: "! grep -rE '(api[_-]?key|secret|token|password)\s*[:=]\s*[\"'\\''][A-Za-z0-9]{16,}' --include='*.rs' --include='*.idr' --include='*.eph' --include='*.toml' crates/ src/ 2>/dev/null | head -1 | grep -q ."
- severity: critical

## Provenance

#### author-correct
- description: Git author matches expected identity
- run: "git log -1 --format='%ae' | grep -qE '(hyperpolymath|j\\.d\\.a\\.jewell|noreply)'"
- severity: warning

#### license-content
- description: LICENSE contains expected identifier
- run: grep -q 'PMPL\|MPL\|MIT\|Apache\|LGPL' LICENSE
- severity: warning

## HAR-Specific Trust

### normative-specs-require-review
- description: The ABI/formal specs are owner-ratified surfaces; agents propose, humans approve
- run: echo "src/abi/*.idr, src/abi/*.eph and docs/decisions/ changes need explicit review"
- severity: advisory
- areas:
  - src/abi/
  - docs/decisions/
  - .machine_readable/
  - GOVERNANCE.adoc
  - .github/CODEOWNERS

### deterministic-routing-invariant
- description: Route selection must stay deterministic for a given (event, candidates, load) — never HashMap-order dependent
- run: cargo test -p har-router
- severity: critical

## Container Security

#### container-images-pinned
- description: Containerfile uses pinned base images
- run: test ! -f Containerfile || grep -q 'cgr.dev\|@sha256:' Containerfile
- severity: warning

#### no-dockerfile
- description: No Dockerfile (use Containerfile)
- run: test ! -f Dockerfile
- severity: warning
